# Store and check out every text file with LF line endings, on every platform.
# The panel deploys to a Linux device; CRLF in the working copy made local
# byte-count comparisons against deployed files report false mismatches.
# 所有文本文件在任何平台都以 LF 存储与检出。面板部署到 Linux 设备，
# 工作区若为 CRLF 会导致本地与部署端的字节数比对出现假不一致。
* text=auto eol=lf
